# Mobile build configuration — loaded by `vite build --mode mobile` (npm run build:mobile).
#
# IMPORTANT: every VITE_* value is PUBLIC. Vite inlines it into the shipped app bundle, so NEVER
# put a secret (OAuth client secret, API key, admin token) here.
#
# A native app cannot use a relative "/api" origin, so point it at your DEPLOYED production API.
# Replace the placeholder below with your real API origin before shipping a store build.
VITE_API_BASE=https://YOUR-PRODUCTION-API.example.com/api
